==Kedah Malay==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/lagu/|lang=meo}}

===Noun===
{{head|meo|noun}}

# Song ''(used in other states as well)''
#: ''Hangpa nak biaq aku ghenggah soghang-soghang ja ka; '''lagu''' ni syok gak ni, mai nyanyi sama!''
#:: ''Are you going to let me do all the singing; this is a good '''song''', join me!''

===Adverb===
{{head|meo|adverb}}

# ''(in that/this)'' Way, manner, like ''(that/this)''
#:  ''Huduh ngat aih hangpa dok jelan lidah '''lagu''' tu, seghupa ngan hantu pa aih!''
#:: ''It is so ugly that you stick out your tongue '''like''' that, you looked like a ghost!''

===Compound Words===

It is usually used as compund words as following:

# lagu mana
#: how
# lagu tu
#: like that
# lagu ni
#: like this
# lagu dia
#: like the way he did it
# lagu Ahmad
#: like the way Ahmad did it

